Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - Dancing Michael}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.31,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.78,0:00:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.82,0:00:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're from the {\i1}Cat Friend{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}magazine. \NWe called the other day.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.42,0:00:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi! We've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.56,0:00:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come on in.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.96,0:00:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the writer for {\i1}Cat Friend{\i0}, Hojo Shino. {they are writing an article for a magazine, not a TV program like the last time}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.13,0:00:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know about our magazine? {??? how could they not know if they called before?}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.08,0:00:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, absolutely!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.73,0:00:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Comment: 10,0:00:32.64,0:00:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{Well!}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.60,0:00:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's him, the dancing cat?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.74,0:00:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I know...\NIt may not seem like it, but he really is!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.09,0:00:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.62,0:00:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how I look at it, \Nhe doesn't look like the dancing type to me. {??? dansu no *** to ha}
Comment: 10,0:00:45.18,0:00:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{Meow!}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.10,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So how does he do it? {??? idk what she means}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.32,0:00:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.62,0:00:50.82,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Ah! No!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.82,0:00:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I also saw it with my own eyes!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.75,0:00:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened when Michael was chasing a fly.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.78,0:01:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.28,0:01:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I saw him do it...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.65,0:01:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What was he doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.95,0:01:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, it happened yesterday\N when I was passing by the park.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.73,0:01:38.23,Thought,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Michael? What's he doing?
Comment: 10,0:02:07.80,0:02:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{Aiya...}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.23,0:02:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.27,0:02:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't he a wonderful kind of cat?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.46,0:02:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wouldn't go that far.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.97,0:02:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,To say it plainly, your cat
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.77,0:02:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,tends to start dancing to hide the fact that he's failed at something? {made a mistake}
Comment: 10,0:02:23.24,0:02:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{Meow?}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.88,0:02:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,W-We'd very much like to get \Na photo of him doing his dance.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.37,0:02:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, absolutely!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.46,0:02:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm. But I wonder if he'll dance for us just like that. {lit: for convenience}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.79,0:02:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can coax him? {was induce it - associated with starting a woman's labor}{if you did something about that}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.01,0:02:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, dear! It's our Michael's best shot at becoming a star!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.99,0:02:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A star?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.13,0:02:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's try it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.92,0:02:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's dance, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.20,0:02:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Un deux trois, un deux trois...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.94,0:02:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That definitely feels like a forced dance.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.24,0:02:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.98,0:02:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.64,0:02:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah... Look, I'm letting him go!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.43,0:03:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to dance! \NQuick, prepare to shoot!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.32,0:03:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.82,0:03:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... What, no good?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.15,0:03:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Hey, wait, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.26,0:03:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.04,0:03:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let go, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.03,0:03:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, dear!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.37,0:03:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.39,0:03:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.19,0:03:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well... If it's come to this, \Nwe need extraordinary measures.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.78,0:03:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, come here! Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.89,0:03:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There, see, Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.69,0:03:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your kitty teaser!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.23,0:03:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, dear! \NMichael is coming this way.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.23,0:03:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes! \NDon't miss your chance for a good shot.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.57,0:03:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.51,0:04:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.72,0:04:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, stay with us! \NWhat on earth are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.97,0:04:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, before that, he danced when he bumped his head, so...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.47,0:04:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not dead, is he?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.96,0:04:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.29,0:04:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hurry! Michael hates being held!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.76,0:04:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't hold him for more than thirty seconds!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.25,0:04:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry, just a moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.60,0:04:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all messed up \Nfrom the commotion earlier.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.26,0:04:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.12,0:04:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{ouch ouch}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.26,0:04:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go! Say "cheese!"
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.51,0:04:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what a shame! \NI almost got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.15,0:04:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.47,0:04:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's good. \NThanks, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.86,0:04:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for your time!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.79,0:04:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this should be enough for our article.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.32,0:04:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll send you a copy when the issue is out.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.15,0:05:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Comment: 10,0:05:03.70,0:05:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{F[ilm]...}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.97,0:05:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to load the film...
Comment: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - Put It All in the Ring}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.82,0:05:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, the main event of this evening,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.09,0:05:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the sixty-minute one-round bout! {same text as in OVA}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.01,0:06:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In the red corner, weighing in at 9.9 pounds, Michael Mask! {I'm still doubtful if they meant "mask" but eh}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.76,0:06:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.07,0:06:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.18,0:06:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.40,0:06:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,In the blue corner, weighing in at 33 pounds, Abdullah the Catzilla! {iri: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdullah_the_Butcher}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.93,0:06:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go home, you fatty! {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.23,0:06:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the showdown of the century!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.52,0:06:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How will Michael Mask stand up \Nto the champion, Abdullah the Catzilla?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.02,0:06:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The main event of the evening \Nis finally starting!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.24,0:06:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, as a special guest, \Nthe owner of Catzilla is here with us.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.03,0:06:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, welcome \Nactress Asaokayama Yukijiko!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.33,0:06:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.78,0:06:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.22,0:06:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, they begin with a cat kick!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.22,0:06:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, there's a violent onslaught of cat kicks! {??? can't hear shit}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.24,0:06:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, Michael! Keep that up!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.56,0:06:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Catzilla suddenly performs a body slam! She throws!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.25,0:06:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But Michael counters it with his signature {\i1}body slam breaker{\i0}! {something that interrupts/counteracts body slam}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.50,0:07:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Attaboy, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.01,0:07:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, Michael! \NSplendid execution!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.39,0:07:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a cat for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.03,0:07:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice, nice!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.33,0:07:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Go for it, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.70,0:07:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Michael's climbed the ropes!\N And he jumps!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.86,0:07:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it an elbow drop?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.54,0:07:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.29,0:07:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoops! It was supposed to be an elbow drop, but instead, he just landed on his feet!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.78,0:07:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't do!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.98,0:07:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,His feline nature must've taken over, \Nand he couldn't help landing on his feet.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.30,0:07:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! Behind you!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.06,0:07:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There he goes! Michael surprises his opponent with a sweeping dropkick! {?????? can't hear shit}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.36,0:07:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But his legs are too short, and he can't reach!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.21,0:07:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Catzilla! This is your chance!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.12,0:07:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's the Boston crab!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.20,0:07:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Cats sure are supple... {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.52,0:07:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.87,0:07:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.98,0:07:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's done for!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.78,0:07:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to reach for the rope!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.54,0:08:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.11,0:08:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, but it doesn't seem to be working!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.55,0:08:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! Michael! Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.53,0:08:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.63,0:08:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.94,0:08:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, fight!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.94,0:08:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatcha looking at?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.30,0:08:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.81,0:08:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.47,0:08:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's almost reached the rope!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.06,0:08:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... You persistent feline. {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.70,0:08:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Toothpaste! That's foul play!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.07,0:08:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What's up with Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.19,0:08:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He backed away from the rope himself.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.89,0:08:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.66,0:08:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Cats can't stand the smell of toothpaste.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.53,0:08:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I had no idea!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.71,0:08:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That hag!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.40,0:08:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down! {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.18,0:08:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, give me Michael's mask and cape!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.42,0:09:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael seemingly isn't able to escape the Boston crab! Now what will he do?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.46,0:09:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You dared to bring your dirty tricks to the ring...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.21,0:09:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It falls to me, the champion of justice, \NTiger Kobayashi, to punish you! {tiger mask parody probably}
Comment: 10,0:09:09.28,0:09:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{a yell}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.15,0:09:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Comment: 10,0:09:12.72,0:09:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{more yells}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.89,0:09:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? \NI'm an actress!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.49,0:09:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.36,0:09:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{??? maybe some special punch name? kuzurashi?}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.43,0:09:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.47,0:09:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, with both fighters brought\N to their senses, the match resumes!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.79,0:09:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both a little hesitant. {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.14,0:09:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief... I'm an actress!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.75,0:09:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight! Fight, I said!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.14,0:09:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.77,0:09:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael is suddenly cowering in the corner!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.24,0:09:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Michael, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.36,0:09:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, fight! Fight!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.28,0:09:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with the referee imploring him, \NMichael won't budge! {make a step outside}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.43,0:10:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems his feline nature \Nhas reared its head again.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.64,0:10:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.11,0:10:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth is, cats hate conflict.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.91,0:10:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.26,0:10:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?! {fuzakeru na?}
Comment: 10,0:10:13.45,0:10:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.85,0:10:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(0,0)\p1\c&H0&}m 0 0 l 640 0 640 480 0 480{\p0}{OPTIONAL - blocks out two bad frames - you can also skip these by using ordered chapters}
Comment: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - I Hate Injections}{resume edit}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.34,0:10:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.91,0:10:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.96,0:10:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Michael. \NI was about to give you your meal.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.50,0:11:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.50,0:11:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, geez, Michael! \NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.74,0:11:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.72,0:11:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael fell into the sink.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.19,0:11:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Good morning, Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.71,0:11:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Michael-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.12,0:11:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No fever, huh? {normal temperature}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.65,0:11:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.46,0:11:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, that's bad.\NDid you catch a cold?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.80,0:11:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No way...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.92,0:11:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, better safe than sorry. {/you can never be too careful}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.48,0:11:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the doctor, Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.50,0:11:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.04,0:11:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.64,0:11:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.32,0:11:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.16,0:11:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.23,0:12:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, be a good boy and come with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.96,0:12:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Michael.\NBe a good boy...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.32,0:12:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.53,0:12:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.20,0:12:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.40,0:12:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You little...{Kono!}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.85,0:12:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.59,0:12:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of the hose!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.38,0:12:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch him yet—
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.06,0:12:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Michael, stop resisting and get in!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.72,0:12:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't growl at me...! {???? not in manga}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.01,0:13:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please quiet down!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.96,0:13:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.23,0:13:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, you... \NDo you want your cold to get worse?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.19,0:13:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.09,0:13:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go, dammit! {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.74,0:13:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to make this so difficult?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.34,0:13:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Cats are just like us humans.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.27,0:13:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps an injection would help.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.51,0:13:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.22,0:13:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Michael! Come down now!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.15,0:13:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.69,0:13:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be dangerous, so please stay back.
Comment: 10,0:13:51.83,0:13:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.45,0:13:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's about the gist of it, ma'am.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.84,0:13:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ma’am!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.54,0:14:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Michael, just get your shot, \Nand we'll be done with it.
Comment: 10,0:14:05.46,0:14:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.96,0:14:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.12,0:14:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.85,0:14:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Michael! \NDon't you know when to stop?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.45,0:14:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, get off me!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.29,0:14:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.81,0:14:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{??}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.81,0:14:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't meow back at me! \NYou're a man, so act like one!  {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.97,0:14:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're ready.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.47,0:14:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.84,0:14:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Michael.\NWe're going home.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.35,0:14:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.03,0:14:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He gave me trouble every step of the way!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.56,0:14:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew, I'm exhausted!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.13,0:14:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.31,0:14:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't "meow" me, you wretched...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.93,0:14:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.70,0:15:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What, now you have a cold too?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.67,0:15:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gimme a break!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.40,0:15:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.09,0:15:12.91,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? \NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.91,0:15:15.45,Song,,0,0,0,,You too will be number one someday
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.45,0:15:18.99,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael?\NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.99,0:15:22.09,Song,,0,0,0,,Now which one is number one? {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.09,0:15:28.03,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? Number one! \NWhat's Michael? Number one!
Comment: 0,0:15:29.07,0:15:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.62,0:15:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's 2:15, so it's time for the {\i1}Hello{\i0} talk show! {think that's the name of the show, konnichiwa}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.63,0:15:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, we have the forever-young actress Asaokayama Yukijiko on the show{was: in attendance}.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.25,0:15:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.85,0:15:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So we know this is going to be your first time playing the lead role,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.89,0:15:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but what are your impressions of your co-star Tsugawa-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.02,0:15:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.61,0:16:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a good person.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.76,0:16:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so? \NI mean, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.61,0:16:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And... the next corner will feature Shino-san. {corner = section of the program; hojo shino, the recurring female journalist}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.80,0:16:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Shino-san, welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.63,0:16:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone! \NHojo Shino the reporter here.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.10,0:16:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, we're introducing to you a cat
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.28,0:16:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,who plays on parallel bars, \Nand is insanely popular on TV. {actually tetsubou is "horizontal bar" but here we see parallel bars so idk}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.14,0:16:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! How did you like it, everyone?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.64,0:16:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,See you next week!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.01,0:16:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, dear?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.74,0:16:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.94,0:16:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, cheer up. Not like it's the first time\N you've missed a deadline.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.05,0:17:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Serialization means the world to a manga artist!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.44,0:17:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lose that, there's no longer any avenue for me to make a comeback!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.79,0:17:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're overreacting! \NThere's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.23,0:17:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If push comes to shove, Michael will bring home some money, as a cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.60,0:17:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael will?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.04,0:17:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, are you seriously considering that?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.14,0:17:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not totally impossible.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.36,0:17:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, he can do {\i1}that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.17,0:17:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.85,0:17:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, go, Michael! \NBring me the game. {prey/catch}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.70,0:17:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's late!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.82,0:17:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael? Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.15,0:18:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess a hunting cat won't work. {ryoken = hound; hunting dog; gun dog}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.59,0:18:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that obvious?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.89,0:18:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're talking doing the other animals' work, \Nthe best cats can do is pull a sled! {dog sled}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.35,0:18:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay... Go!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.15,0:18:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Get going!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.84,0:18:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.61,0:18:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it... That's why I said sledding doesn't go well with cats!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.23,0:18:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course a cat wouldn't pull a sled \Nat the risk of freezing its butt off! {lit: when it's shittily cold/cold as fuck}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.12,0:19:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our new cat on narcotics investigation duty, Michael. {episode title}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.63,0:19:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your work. \NWe have some jobs for you right away.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.63,0:19:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you smell any narcotics, let us know.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.12,0:19:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.82,0:19:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to look inside to make sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.56,0:19:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.80,0:19:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.60,0:19:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Dried bonito... {katsuobushi; pieces of sliced dried bonito​}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.78,0:19:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo! That's correct!{??}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.49,0:19:42.50,Song,,0,0,0,,Meow-meow, the Michael dance! Meow! {opening song}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.84,0:19:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mix up work \Nwith your own preferences!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.71,0:19:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Michael?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.93,0:20:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to check inside!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.10,0:20:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.70,0:20:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat powder. Pickled in sake lees. {??? lit: silver vine (Actinidia polygama); cat powder​, sir. done with vegetables pickled in sake lees, sir.}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.81,0:20:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{na-na[razuke]}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.62,0:20:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's hopeless.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.79,0:20:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, if we're sending our cat to work, \Nwe should pick a more lucrative field.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.26,0:20:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A more lucrative field, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.17,0:20:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! Horse racing! \NNo, cat racing! {cat horse racing}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.66,0:20:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, the gate opens, \Nand all the racecats have started! {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.64,0:20:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...Or not! {/have not}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.24,0:20:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What, no good?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.26,0:20:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, finding a job \Nthat Michael can perform is no easy task.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.58,0:20:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.92,0:20:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I just have to work hard \Nwithout relying on Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.10,0:20:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.89,0:21:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Isono here! \NAre you home, Sensei?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.35,0:21:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.87,0:21:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Ma'am? Where's Sensei?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.55,0:21:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes, I'm right here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.30,0:21:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd like to feature your work\N in a special issue.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.60,0:21:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll gladly do it! \NPlease, come on in.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,{signs}
