Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:44.43,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(555,50)\fs20\c&HBDC7C2&\blur0.7\fn@Arial Rounded MT Bold Eclipse\frz359.9\pos(322.31,84.61)}Episode 3 | Part 2 \N{\fs50}Put It All in the Ring {リングに賭ける} {parody of https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ring_ni_Kakero}
