Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.41,0:15:34.68,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(555,50)\fs20\c&HB8CCC1&\blur0.7\fn@Arial Rounded MT Bold Eclipse\frz359.9\pos(339.24,83.38)}Episode 3 | Part 4\N{\fs50}Narcotics Inspector Michael {麻薬捜査官マイケル}{sus name lol, it actually refers to the dogs that smell the bags in the airports and such}
